WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Cornell box, no medium.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Light fog: absorption only, blue absorbed most.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Heavy fog: warmer and darker with depth.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
In-scattering, isotropic (g = 0).

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
In-scattering, forward (g = 0.5).

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.500
Hero scene: light shafts through a window, 4096 samples per pixel.
